# warnings

## INVALID_OPTION

```text
[INVALID_OPTION] `preserveEntrySignatures: 'allow-extension'` is set implicitly by Rolldown

- `codeSplitting.includeDependenciesRecursively = false` requires `preserveEntrySignatures` to be either `false` or 'allow-extension'

To fix:

- Set `preserveEntrySignatures` either to `false` or 'allow-extension' in your config

```

# Assets

## app.js

```js
import { a as barrel_exports, c as require_mut, d as read_counter_n, f as require_counter, l as read_bad_x, o as read_barrel_exports_y, s as read_mut_m, u as require_bad } from "./group.js";
// app.js
var import_counter = require_counter();
var import_bad = require_bad();
var import_mut = require_mut();
var calls = import_bad.calls;
var m = read_mut_m(import_mut);
var n = read_counter_n(import_counter);
var reads = import_counter.reads;
var setM = import_mut.setM;
var x = read_bad_x(import_bad);
var y = read_barrel_exports_y(barrel_exports);
var yReads = barrel_exports.yReads;
export { calls, m, n, reads, setM, x, y, yReads };

```

